---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — Markdy"
  description="Privacy policy, Cloudflare Web Analytics disclosure, local storage details, and playground data handling for the Markdy documentation and animated diagram playground."
  canonicalURL="https://markdy.com/privacy/"
  keywords="Markdy privacy, Cloudflare Web Analytics, playground privacy, open-source documentation privacy, local storage disclosure"
>
  <div class="legal-container">
    <div class="legal-content">
      <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to Markdy</a>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: August 2026</p>

      <section>
        <h2>1. Overview</h2>
        <p>Markdy is an open-source project. This privacy policy applies to the documentation and playground website hosted at <code>markdy.com</code>. Your privacy is important to us, and we are committed to being transparent about the data we collect.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>2. Data Collection</h2>
        <p>Markdy.com uses Cloudflare Web Analytics to understand aggregate site traffic and Core Web Vitals. Cloudflare Web Analytics is cookie-free and reports metrics such as page URL, referrer, browser, country, device type, and performance timings. We do not run advertising pixels or behavioral tracking.</p>
        <p>Static hosting infrastructure may also create standard server logs such as request URL, timestamp, user agent, and IP address for security and reliability.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>3. Local Storage</h2>
        <p>This website uses your browser's local storage to save your preference for the <strong>Light/Dark theme</strong>. This data never leaves your device and is not transmitted to our servers.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>4. Open Source and Code Submissions</h2>
        <p>Any code you type into the interactive playground is executed entirely in your browser. We do not transmit or save the code snippets you write locally.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>5. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>Because Markdy.com does not operate accounts, advertising pixels, or user profiles, there is no Markdy account profile to export or delete. You can clear the saved theme preference at any time by clearing this site's local storage in your browser.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>6. Contact</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please open an issue in the Markdy repository on GitHub or reach out to the maintainer privately.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-container {
    padding: max(3.5rem, calc(2.5rem + var(--sat))) 1rem 4rem;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }
  .legal-content {
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    padding: 3rem;
    border-radius: 16px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }
  .back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 6vw, 2.5rem);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  .last-updated {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  section {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  p {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  ul {
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .legal-container {
      padding: max(2.5rem, calc(2rem + var(--sat))) 0.75rem 3rem;
    }
    .legal-content {
      padding: 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 12px;
    }
  }
</style>
